# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Vertical-dimension reference frames — aviation altitude / maritime depth (#93)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Principle 11: every measured value lives in an explicit reference frame.
# Altitude and depth are frame-relative; conversion between MSL, AGL, flight
# level, and chart datum is a solver-layer computation (Principle 12).
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
gmeow:referenceFrameRobotSLAM skos:definition "The robot slam reference frame — a named coordinate system or value space together with its axes, origin, and transformation rules (Principle 11)."@x-gmeow-english ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/places> .

